,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3925.869601637,"data":"       | Case 2: all ones (d_k = 1 for all k). Then rule: always move north (increment j). So T(i,j) = (i, j+1). This also decomposes into 12 cycles (one per i). So not a single cycle.\n"}
