,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3925.869604152,"data":"       | Case 3: alternating pattern starting with 0 at even k, 1 at odd k (i.e., d_even=0, d_odd=1). Let's denote pattern: d_k = 0 if k even, 1 if k odd. Let's analyze the permutation.\n"}
