,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":3925.870048132,"data":"       | Define n=m=2 (i.e., 2×2 grid). Number of vertices =4. Moves east (increment first coordinate mod2) or north (increment second coordinate mod2). Need Hamiltonian cycles length 4 covering all vertices. Let's brute force for n=2,m=2.assistantanalysis to=python codeimport itertools\n"}
