,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18555455,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185555587,"data":"       | Our t values are between 1.25 and 1.75, which fall in the second case (t \u003e 1). So area = (2 - t)^2 /2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18555684,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185557888,"data":"       | Thus for each a, area = (2 - t)^2 /2 = (2 - (7 - 2a)/4)^2 /2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18555901,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185560035,"data":"       | Simplify: t = (7 - 2a)/4.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185561092,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185562128,"data":"       | Compute 2 - t = 2 - (7 - 2a)/4 = (8 - (7 - 2a))/4 = (8 - 7 + 2a)/4 = (1 + 2a)/4 = (2a + 1)/4.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.1855633,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185564318,"data":"       | Thus area = ((2a + 1)/4)^2 /2 = ( (2a + 1)^2 ) / (32).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18556545,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185566757,"data":"       | Thus volume in (a,b,c) space for region above plane = ∫_{a=0}^{1} area(a) da = ∫_0^1 (2a + 1)^2 / 32 da.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185567986,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18556936,"data":"       | Compute integral: ∫ ( (4a^2 + 4a + 1) ) /32 da = (1/32) ∫ (4a^2 + 4a + 1) da = (1/32) [ (4 * a^3/3) + (4 * a^2/2) + a ] from 0 to 1 = (1/32) [ (4/3) + (4/2) + 1 ] = (1/32) [ (4/3) + 2 + 1 ] = (1/32) [ (4/3) + 3 ] = (1/32) [ (4/3) + (9/3) ] = (1/32) * (13/3) = 13 / 96.\n"}
