,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185574042,"data":"       | Multiply by scaling factor 216 to get actual volume above plane: V_air = 216 * 13/96 = (216/96) * 13 = (9/4) * 13? Let's compute: 216/96 = simplify: divide by 24 =\u003e 9/4. Yes. So V_air = (9/4) * 13 = 117/4 = 29.25.\n"}
