,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185656546,"data":"       | The Gram matrix of \\(\\{u_h,v_h,w_h\\}\\) must have determinant \\(0\\) (they lie in a plane).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185657905,"data":"       | Its determinant is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185658987,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185660245,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185661287,"data":"       | \\det\\begin{pmatrix}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185662578,"data":"       | s^{2}-4 \u0026 -8 \u0026 -8\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185663802,"data":"       | -8 \u0026 s^{2}-16 \u0026 -16\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185665105,"data":"       | -8 \u0026 -16 \u0026 s^{2}-16\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185666257,"data":"       | \\end{pmatrix}=s^{4}(s-6)(s+6),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185667489,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185668515,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185671154,"data":"       | so \\(s=6\\) m.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185672382,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185673568,"data":"       | Hence the cube’s side length is \\(6\\) m and its total volume is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185674872,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18567599,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185677028,"data":"       | V_{\\text{cube}}=6^{3}=216\\text{ m}^{3}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18567847,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185679488,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185680586,"data":"       | ---\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185681645,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185682748,"data":"       | ### Using the parameterisation of the cube\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185683845,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185684853,"data":"       | Write any point of the cube as  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185685938,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185686945,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185687978,"data":"       | \\mathbf p = a\\,u+b\\,v+c\\,w,\\qquad 0\\le a,b,c\\le 1 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185689297,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185690346,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185691351,"data":"       | Its height above \\(\\mathcal P\\) is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185692507,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185693523,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185694862,"data":"       | z = a\\,u_z+b\\,v_z+c\\,w_z = 2a+4b+4c .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18569602,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18569706,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185698073,"data":"       | The water surface is the plane \\(z=7\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185699271,"data":"       | Thus the region **above** the water satisfies  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185700362,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185701369,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.1857024,"data":"       | 2a+4b+4c\\ge 7 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18570348,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185704524,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185705563,"data":"       | In the unit cube \\([0,1]^3\\) this inequality cuts off a tetrahedral region.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185706818,"data":"       | For a fixed \\(a\\) let \\(t=\\dfrac{7-2a}{4}\\;(1.25\\le t\\le1.75)\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18570815,"data":"       | The condition becomes \\(b+c\\ge t\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185709352,"data":"       | Since \\(t\u003e1\\), the admissible \\((b,c)\\) form a right triangle of side \\(2-t\\); its area is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185710748,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185711753,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185712799,"data":"       | \\frac{(2-t)^2}{2}= \\frac{(2a+1)^2}{32}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185713948,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185714968,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185716007,"data":"       | Hence the volume in \\((a,b,c)\\)-space of the air region is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185719242,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185720261,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185721301,"data":"       | \\int_{0}^{1}\\frac{(2a+1)^2}{32}\\,da\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185722517,"data":"       |    =\\frac{13}{96}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185723598,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185724637,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185725682,"data":"       | The linear map \\((a,b,c)\\mapsto \\mathbf p\\) multiplies volume by \\(|\\det[u\\;v\\;w]|=|u||v||w|=6^{3}=216\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185727095,"data":"       | Therefore  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185728214,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185729248,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185730314,"data":"       | V_{\\text{air}} = 216\\cdot\\frac{13}{96}= \\frac{117}{4}\\text{ m}^{3}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.1857316,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185732609,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185733616,"data":"       | Consequently the water volume is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185734728,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185735764,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185736822,"data":"       | V_{\\text{water}} = V_{\\text{cube}}-V_{\\text{air}}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185738005,"data":"       |                  = 216-\\frac{117}{4}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185739137,"data":"       |                  = \\frac{747}{4}\\text{ m}^{3}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185740306,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185741323,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185742366,"data":"       | Writing \\(\\dfrac{747}{4}\\) as \\(\\dfrac{m}{n}\\) with \\(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\) gives \\(m=747,\\;n=4\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185743803,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185744828,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185745897,"data":"       | m+n = 747+4 = 751.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18574694,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185747955,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185748968,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185749988,"data":"       | \\boxed{751}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.185751068,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
