,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187489095,"data":"       | Now we need to present reasoning clearly: derive side length s=6, compute heights linear function, set up inequality x+2y+2z ≤ 21, integrate to find volume 747/4, sum m+n = 751.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18749127,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187492903,"data":"       | Let's craft final answer.assistantfinalLet the three mutually perpendicular edges of the cube be the vectors  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18749487,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187496462,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187498211,"data":"       | \\mathbf u,\\;\\mathbf v,\\;\\mathbf w ,\\qquad |\\mathbf u|=|\\mathbf v|=|\\mathbf w|=s .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187500385,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18750201,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187503657,"data":"       | Choose the origin at vertex \\(A\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18750553,"data":"       | Then  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187507185,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187508858,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187510019,"data":"       | A=0,\\qquad B=\\mathbf u ,\\qquad C=\\mathbf v+\\mathbf w ,\\qquad \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187511335,"data":"       | D=\\mathbf u+\\mathbf v+\\mathbf w .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187512508,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187513555,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187514606,"data":"       | Thus  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187515684,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187516759,"data":"       | * \\(AB\\) and \\(CD\\) are the parallel edges \\(\\mathbf u\\);\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187518105,"data":"       | * \\(AC\\) and \\(BD\\) are the face‑diagonals \\(\\mathbf v+\\mathbf w\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187519773,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187521445,"data":"       | --------------------------------------------------------------------\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187523467,"data":"       | ### 1.  Height function\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187525265,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187526967,"data":"       | Let the horizontal plane \\(\\mathcal P\\) be the plane \\(z=0\\) and let the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18752913,"data":"       | vertical unit vector be \\(\\mathbf k\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187532692,"data":"       | Because the rectangle \\(ABDC\\) is perpendicular to \\(\\mathcal P\\), its\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187534975,"data":"       | normal \\(\\mathbf u\\times(\\mathbf v+\\mathbf w)\\) must be orthogonal to\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187537086,"data":"       | \\(\\mathbf k\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187539455,"data":"       | With \\(\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v,\\mathbf w\\) orthogonal this gives\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187541567,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187543207,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187544867,"data":"       | \\mathbf k = a\\mathbf e_1+b\\mathbf e_2+b\\mathbf e_3,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187546835,"data":"       | \\qquad a^2+2b^2=1,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187548556,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187550263,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187551887,"data":"       | where \\(\\mathbf e_i\\) are unit vectors in the directions of\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187553818,"data":"       | \\(\\mathbf u,\\mathbf v,\\mathbf w\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187555642,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187557236,"data":"       | The height of a vertex \\(X\\) is the dot product \\(\\mathbf k\\!\\cdot\\!X\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187559327,"data":"       | Hence\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187561021,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187562618,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187564337,"data":"       | \\begin{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187566058,"data":"       | h_A\u0026=0,\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187567928,"data":"       | h_B\u0026=s a = 2,\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.1875697,"data":"       | h_C\u0026=2sb = 8,\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187571428,"data":"       | h_D\u0026=s(a+2b)=10 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187573157,"data":"       | \\end{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187574825,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187576494,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187578154,"data":"       | From the first two equations \\(a=\\dfrac{2}{s},\\;b=\\dfrac{4}{s}\\); substituting\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187580292,"data":"       | into the third gives \\(s(a+2b)=10\\), which is automatically satisfied.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187582195,"data":"       | Using \\(a^2+2b^2=1\\),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187583955,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187585572,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187587235,"data":"       | \\Bigl(\\frac{2}{s}\\Bigr)^2+2\\Bigl(\\frac{4}{s}\\Bigr)^2=1\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187589315,"data":"       | \\Longrightarrow \\frac{36}{s^{2}}=1\\Longrightarrow s=6\\text{ m}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187591622,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187592797,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187593817,"data":"       | Thus  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18759486,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187595875,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187596937,"data":"       | a=\\frac13,\\qquad b=\\frac23 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187598105,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187600404,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187601472,"data":"       | --------------------------------------------------------------------\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18760264,"data":"       | ### 2.  Coordinates of the cube\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187604452,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187606167,"data":"       | Take the orthonormal basis \\(\\{\\mathbf e_1,\\mathbf e_2,\\mathbf e_3\\}\\) as the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187608412,"data":"       | standard \\(x,y,z\\) axes.  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187610161,"data":"       | Then  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187611753,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18761336,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187615032,"data":"       | \\begin{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187616848,"data":"       | A\u0026=(0,0,0),\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187618776,"data":"       | B\u0026=(6,0,0),\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187620543,"data":"       | V\u0026=(0,6,0),\\qquad W=(0,0,6),\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187622552,"data":"       | V+W\u0026=(0,6,6)=C,\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187624347,"data":"       | U+V+W\u0026=(6,6,6)=D,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18762609,"data":"       | \\end{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187627787,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187630708,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187632407,"data":"       | and the remaining vertices are \\((6,6,0)\\) and \\((6,0,6)\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187634513,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187636143,"data":"       | The vertical direction is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187637892,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187639485,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187641107,"data":"       | \\mathbf k=\\Bigl(\\frac13,\\frac23,\\frac23\\Bigr),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187643027,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187644849,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18764654,"data":"       | so the height of a point \\((x,y,z)\\) is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187648389,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18764998,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18765167,"data":"       | h(x,y,z)=\\mathbf k\\!\\cdot\\!(x,y,z)=\\frac{x+2y+2z}{3}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187653601,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187655328,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187656988,"data":"       | The given heights correspond to the six vertices whose heights are\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187659062,"data":"       | \\(0,2,4,4,6,6\\); the two vertices with heights \\(8\\) and \\(10\\) are\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187661127,"data":"       | \\(C\\) and \\(D\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187662878,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187664516,"data":"       | --------------------------------------------------------------------\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187666351,"data":"       | ### 3.  Region occupied by water\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18766808,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187669713,"data":"       | Water fills the part of the cube where the height is at most \\(7\\) m.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187673395,"data":"       | Hence the water region is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187675065,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18767677,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187677835,"data":"       | \\{(x,y,z)\\in[0,6]^3\\mid x+2y+2z\\le 21\\}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187679047,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187680088,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187681104,"data":"       | Its volume is  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187682196,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.1876832,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187684232,"data":"       | V=\\iiint_{0}^{6}\\!\\!\\int_{0}^{6}\\!\\!\\int_{0}^{6}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18768552,"data":"       | \\mathbf 1_{\\,x+2y+2z\\le 21}\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187687063,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187688848,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18769054,"data":"       | Integrate first with respect to \\(x\\):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187692402,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187694075,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187695761,"data":"       | V=\\int_{0}^{6}\\!\\!\\int_{0}^{6}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187697598,"data":"       | \\min\\!\\bigl(6,\\;21-2y-2z\\bigr)_{+}\\,dy\\,dz .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187699693,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187701505,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187703175,"data":"       | For a fixed \\((y,z)\\),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187705069,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187706861,"data":"       | * if \\(y+z\\le 7.5\\) then \\(21-2y-2z\\ge 6\\) and the inner minimum is \\(6\\);\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187709048,"data":"       | * if \\(7.5\u003cy+z\u003c10.5\\) the inner minimum equals \\(21-2y-2z\\);\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187711145,"data":"       | * if \\(y+z\\ge10.5\\) the region contributes nothing.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18771305,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187714713,"data":"       | Thus\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187716385,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187718038,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187719709,"data":"       | \\begin{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187721418,"data":"       | V\u0026=6\\cdot\\operatorname{area}\\{y+z\\le7.5\\}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187723407,"data":"       |    +\\iint_{7.5\u003cy+z\u003c10.5}(21-2y-2z)\\,dy\\,dz \\\\[2mm]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187725503,"data":"       |  \u0026=6\\Bigl(36-\\frac{1}{2}(4.5)^2\\Bigr)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187727373,"data":"       |    +\\int_{7.5}^{10.5}(21-2s)(12-s)\\,ds ,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187729265,"data":"       | \\end{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187730961,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187732565,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187734184,"data":"       | where \\(s=y+z\\) and for \\(6\\le s\\le12\\) the length of the line\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187736157,"data":"       | segment \\(\\{y+z=s\\}\\) inside the square \\([0,6]^2\\) is \\(12-s\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187739716,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187741415,"data":"       | Evaluating,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187743105,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187744727,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187746378,"data":"       | \\begin{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187748085,"data":"       | 6\\Bigl(36-\\frac{20.25}{2}\\Bigr)\u0026=6\\cdot\\frac{207}{8}= \\frac{621}{4},\\\\\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187750188,"data":"       | \\int_{7.5}^{10.5}(21-2s)(12-s)\\,ds\u0026=\\frac{63}{2}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187752141,"data":"       | \\end{aligned}\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187753803,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18775548,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18775703,"data":"       | Hence  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187759227,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187760337,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187761373,"data":"       | V=\\frac{621}{4}+\\frac{63}{2}= \\frac{747}{4}\\ \\text{m}^3 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187762639,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187763671,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18776469,"data":"       | --------------------------------------------------------------------\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187765838,"data":"       | ### 4.  Answer\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18776689,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187768231,"data":"       | The water volume is \\(\\displaystyle\\frac{747}{4}\\) cubic metres.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187769545,"data":"       | Writing \\(\\frac{747}{4}=\\frac{m}{n}\\) with \\(\\gcd(m,n)=1\\) gives\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187771608,"data":"       | \\(m=747,\\;n=4\\).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187773456,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.1877752,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187776838,"data":"       | m+n=747+4= \\boxed{751}.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.187778652,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
