,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.189140082,"data":"       | Similarly, we have CD = e1, so D = C + e1 =\u003e D height = 8 + 2 = 10, matches given. Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.189141413,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.189142549,"data":"       | Thus we have unknowns: e1 components (x,y,2). e2 components (a,b,c). e3 components (d,e,f). Conditions:\n"}
