,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18918502,"data":"       | 10) (r + t)^2 + (s2 + v)^2 + (u + w)^2 = 2 L^2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.189186228,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.18918762,"data":"       | But we already have (u + w) = 8, so (u + w)^2 = 64.\n"}
