,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.190928714,"data":"       | sqrtΔ = sqrt(2 s^2 - 72). So p = (8 + sqrtΔ)/2 = 4 + sqrtΔ/2. q = 4 - sqrtΔ/2 (or vice versa). So p and q differ.\n"}
