,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.191485951,"data":"       | For p ≥ 5, area5 = (p + 2)/(2p) = (p+2)/(2p). For p \u003c5, area5 = (p**2 - 8 p + 9/2)/(p*(p - 8)). Let's simplify that second expression.\n"}
