,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.191488581,"data":"       | Similarly for area7: for p ≥ 7, area7 = (p+6)/(2p). For p\u003c7, area7 = (p**2 - 8 p + 1/2)/(p*(p - 8)).\n"}
