,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192107016,"data":"       | We need to find p (i.e., v_z) such that the water volume is rational m/n? But problem says volume is m/n cubic meters (a rational number) and asks for m+n. So we need to compute volume exactly and find m+n.\n"}
