,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192283513,"data":"       | Now compute water volume.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192284689,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192285793,"data":"       | We have p = q = 4.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192286947,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192288087,"data":"       | Thus the linear height function: h(a,b,c) = 2 a + 4 b + 4 c.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.19228934,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192290491,"data":"       | We need volume of points (a,b,c) ∈ [0,1]^3 with 2 a + 4 b + 4 c ≤ 7.\n"}
