,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.192329057,"data":"       | Recall earlier we derived V0 formula for p≥7 etc. But p=4 \u003c5, so we are in region p\u003c5 (i.e., p∈[4,5)). Use V0 expression: (p^2 - 8p + 13/6) / (p (p - 8)). Let's compute for p=4.\n"}
