,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.193190647,"data":"       | analysisThus eq2: 4*sqrt(2)*x + 8 = 0 =\u003e x = -8/(4*sqrt(2)) = -2/ sqrt(2) = -sqrt(2). So x = -sqrt(2). Good.\n"}
