,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.194184856,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.194186118,"data":"       | Now we need to compute area for T values (5 to 7). For each T, the region area depends on a,b thresholds. Let's treat general case.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.194187502,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.194188616,"data":"       | Assume a \u003c= b (if not, swap names). Since a+b=8, whichever is smaller.\n"}
