,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4140.194201489,"data":"       | Now b can be ≥4; could be less than 5? If b is between 4 and5, then T may be greater than b for some T? Actually T max is 7 \u003e b, min 5 maybe \u003e b depending. So T may be \u003e b (i.e., larger than b) for all α if b \u003c5? But b≥4, could be 4.5, etc.\n"}
