,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4194.437420622,"data":"       | v = math.sqrt(13 - x**2 - u**2)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4194.437422013,"data":"       | c = (x, u, v)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4194.437423095,"data":"       | vol = abs(triple(a,b,c))\n"}
