,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4194.437964798,"data":"       | General formula for determinant of matrix with a on diagonal and off-diagonal x,y,z: det = a^3 + 2xyz - a(x^2 + y^2 + z^2). Indeed for symmetric matrix with same diagonal a. So we can use that.\n"}
