,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4194.43797862,"data":"       | Now term 2 s1 s2 s3 = 2 * (±5/2)^3 * sign product. (5/2)^3 = 125/8. So 2 * (125/8) = 250/8 = 125/4. Multiply by sign product ε = ε1 ε2 ε3 (since each s_i includes sign). So term = (125/4) * ε.\n"}
