,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4194.439031838,"data":"       | Now we have three vectors a,b,c such that each pair (a,b), (a,c), (b,c) forms such a rhombus with those diagonal lengths. So for each unordered pair {u,v} from {a,b,c} we have |u|=|v| (since sides equal) and the diagonals lengths condition.\n"}
