,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.936789522,"data":"       | Now s^n + t^n may be expressed using recurrence based on s + t and s t. Since s and t satisfy quadratic with coefficients maybe not rational but in Q(√17). However s^n + t^n might be expressed as a linear combination of (s + t)^k and (s t)^k? Not straightforward.\n"}
