,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.937054765,"data":"       | We have s^2 = (1+√17)/2. Then s^4 = ((1+√17)/2)^2 = (1 + 2√17 + 17)/4 = (18 + 2√17)/4 = (9 + √17)/2. Similarly t^4 = ((√17-1)/2)^2 = (17 - 2√17 +1)/4 = (18 - 2√17)/4 = (9 - √17)/2. Then s^4 + t^4 = (9+√17)/2 + (9-√17)/2 = 9. Indeed a_4 = 9.\n"}
