,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.937062959,"data":"       | Thus we can see that a_{4k} = integer sequence: 9, 49, 297, 1889, 12249, 80017, ... This looks like recurrence maybe a_{k+1} = 6 a_k - a_{k-1}? Let's test.\n"}
