,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.937462868,"data":"       | Since c^2 known, we can compute numerator: 1 + 2c^2 = 1 + 2 * ((-1 + s)/8) = 1 + ((-1 + s)/4) = (4/4) + (-1 + s)/4 = (4 -1 + s)/4 = (3 + s)/4.\n"}
