,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.938520984,"data":"       | Thus s and t are roots of some quadratic? Let's consider variable x = s, then t = 2 / s. Then s^2 - (2/s)^2 = 1 =\u003e s^2 - 4/s^2 = 1 =\u003e multiply s^2: s^4 - 4 = s^2 =\u003e s^4 - s^2 - 4 = 0. So s satisfies quartic.\n"}
