,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.940752054,"data":"       | From pattern: n=4 gave 9 (units digit 9). n=8 gave 49 (units digit 9). n=12 gave 297 (units digit 7). Wait 297 ends with 7, not 9. So not all multiples of 4 produce units digit 9.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.940754219,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.940755951,"data":"       | Thus we need to examine the sequence a_k = s^{4k} + t^{4k} for k=1..250, integer values. Determine which have units digit 9.\n"}
