,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.941970081,"data":"       | sqrt(17) ≈ 4.1231, -1+sqrt(17) = 3.1231, divide by 8 → 0.390386... So c^2 = ( -1 + sqrt(17) )/8.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.941971591,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4266.941972671,"data":"       | Thus cos A = sqrt( ( -1 + sqrt(17) ) /8 ). Since acute angle, cos\u003e0.\n"}
