,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.290413969,"data":"       | Now we need point P inside triangle such that angle AEP = angle BFP = angle CDP. So the three angles at points E, F, D respectively with lines from those points to P and to the vertices A, B, C respectively are equal.\n"}
