,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.290506764,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.290507863,"data":"       | Now note that angle between side BC and DP at D is same as angle between line DP and side BC. Since D is on BC, the direction of side BC is same as direction of line BD or DC. So angle between DP and BC is same as angle between DP and line through D along BC. This is essentially the angle between DP and BC.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.290509507,"data":"       | \n"}
