,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.291047437,"data":"       | - D: B (55,0) + (7/55)*(C-B). C-B = (-55/2, 55*sqrt3/2). Multiply by 7/55 = 7/55. So D = (55 - (7/55)*(55/2) = 55 - 7/2 = 55 - 3.5 = 51.5 = 103/2). y: 0 + (7/55)*(55*sqrt3/2) = 7*sqrt3/2. So D = (103/2, 7*sqrt3/2). Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29104894,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.291050033,"data":"       | - E: C + (30/55)*(A-C) = C - (30/55)*(C) = (1 - 30/55)C = (25/55)C = (5/11)C. Since C coordinates (55/2, 55*sqrt3/2). Multiply by 5/11: (55/2)*(5/11) = 55*5/(22) = 25/2? Wait compute: 55/2 * 5/11 = (55*5)/(22) = 275/22 = 12.5? Actually 275/22 = 12.5 = 25/2. Yes x = 25/2. y = (55*sqrt3/2)*(5/11) = 55*5*sqrt3/(22) = 275*sqrt3/22 = (125*sqrt3)/10? Let's compute: 275/22 = 12.5 = 25/2. So y = (25/2)*sqrt3. Indeed E = (25/2, 25*sqrt3/2). Good.\n"}
