,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29226239,"data":"       | D = B + (7/55)*(C-B). Compute: B=(55,0). C-B = (-55/2, 55*sqrt3/2). Multiply by 7/55: (-7/2, 7*sqrt3/2). Add to B: (55-7/2= (110-7)/2 = 103/2 = 51.5), y = 7*sqrt3/2 ≈ 6.062. So D coordinate correct.\n"}
