,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29253228,"data":"     [Reasoning] (1389 chars):\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292533364,"data":"       | analysisNow we need also that point P (the common intersection) lies on the third rotated line: D + v*R(DC) = same coordinates.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292534627,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292535767,"data":"       | But we can solve for t,u in terms of c,s from first two equations, then compute P coordinates and then impose that vector from D to P is parallel to rotated DC (i.e., there exists v such that equality holds). Equivalent to cross product zero: (P - D) is proportional to rotate(DC). So we can impose that (P - D) is orthogonal to a vector perpendicular to rotate(DC). Simpler: we can solve for v as unknown as well, using equality of coordinates with same P.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292537566,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292538577,"data":"       | Thus add unknown v, and equality with D line.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292539657,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292540707,"data":"       | Let's set unknown v and add equations:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292541794,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29254284,"data":"       | P = E + t*R(EA) = F + u*R(FB) = D + v*R(DC).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292543951,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292544963,"data":"       | So we add two more equations for equality between E+... and D+..., giving two component equations.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29254614,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292547144,"data":"       | Thus total equations: 4 component equations (E-F equality 2; E-D equality 2) plus constraint c^2 + s^2 = 1.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292548367,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292549401,"data":"       | Unknowns: c,s,t,u,v (5 unknowns). 5 equations. Good.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292550514,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292553026,"data":"       | Let's set up and solve.\n"}
