,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292748272,"data":"       | ### 2.  Rotating the side‑vectors  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292749416,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292750447,"data":"       | Let \\(\\theta=\\angle AEP=\\angle BFP=\\angle CDP\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292751697,"data":"       | For a vector \\(\\mathbf v=(v_x,v_y)\\) denote by  \n"}
