,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292760246,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292761434,"data":"       | Because \\(\\angle AEP=\\theta\\), the line \\(EP\\) is obtained by rotating\n"}
