,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292826427,"data":"       | DC = C - D.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29282745,"data":"       | DP = P - D.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292828481,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292829494,"data":"       | Set cosθ equality: (EA·EP)/(|EA||EP|) = (FB·FP)/(|FB||FP|) = (DC·DP)/(|DC||DP|).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292830764,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292831801,"data":"       | We could set pairwise equality: (EA·EP)/(|EA||EP|) = (FB·FP)/(|FB||FP|) and similarly with DC.\n"}
