,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.292838444,"data":"       | After solving for P, compute angle θ using any of the cos values, then compute tan^2 θ = sin^2 θ / cos^2 θ = (1 - cos^2 θ)/cos^2 θ = (1 / cos^2 θ) - 1.\n"}
