,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29322883,"data":"       | We can perhaps apply known formula: For any point inside triangle, define angles at points on sides relative to vertices, we have relation using law of sines: (AE/CE)*(CF/AF)*(BD/DB?) Not.\n"}
