,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293294997,"data":"       | But we can compute cosθ from equality of ratios.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293296166,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293297197,"data":"       | Let’s define k = cosθ. Then we have dot(EA, EP) = k*|EA|*|EP| etc. Square both sides to remove sqrt.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293298434,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293299471,"data":"       | But we may end up with polynomial equations; solving may yield cosθ value independent of P.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293300691,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293301713,"data":"       | We could attempt to eliminate x,y and solve for k. Let's try using sympy elimination.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293302931,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293303936,"data":"       | Define k as variable. Equations:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293305004,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293306044,"data":"       | dot(EA, EP) - k*|EA|*|EP| = 0   (eqA)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293307134,"data":"       | dot(FB, FP) - k*|FB|*|FP| = 0   (eqB)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293308238,"data":"       | dot(DC, DP) - k*|DC|*|DP| = 0   (eqC)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293309311,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293310353,"data":"       | We have three equations with unknowns x,y,k. Solve for k maybe.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293311517,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293312526,"data":"       | But the equations have square roots due to |EP| etc. Could square each to get polynomial: (dot(EA, EP))^2 = k^2 * |EA|^2 * |EP|^2.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293313761,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293314761,"data":"       | Let’s define constants: lenEA2 = EA·EA, lenFB2 = FB·FB, lenDC2 = DC·DC. Those are known numbers.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293316016,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293317047,"data":"       | Then equations become:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.293318097,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4322.29331911,"data":"       | (dot(EA, EP))^2 - k^2 * lenEA2 * ((x-Ex)^2 + (y-Ey)^2) =0 etc.\n"}
