,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.462331905,"data":"       | ### 2.  Point \\(Q\\) on \\(AM\\) with \\(\\angle PBQ=\\angle PCQ\\)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.462334022,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.462335697,"data":"       | Write a generic point on \\(AM\\) as  \n"}
