,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.462624046,"data":"       | Now line AM: passes through A(5,12) and M(7,0). Parameter t: point = A + t*(M-A). When t=0 -\u003e A, t=1 -\u003e M. Extend beyond M: t\u003e1.\n"}
