,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.463667274,"data":"       | analysisLet's just compute coordinates rationally: (567/74, -147/37). Note -147/37 = -147/37 = -3.972972..., and 567/74 = 7.662162... Let's verify.\n"}
