,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468022412,"data":"       | AB^2 = x_A^2 + y_A^2 = 13^2 = 169.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468024177,"data":"       | AC^2 = (x_A -14)^2 + y_A^2 = 15^2 =225.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468025918,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468027629,"data":"       | Subtract first from second: (x_A -14)^2 - x_A^2 = 225 -169 =56.\n"}
