,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468031143,"data":"       | Compute: (x_A^2 -28x_A +196) - x_A^2 = -28x_A +196 =56 =\u003e -28x_A = -140 =\u003e x_A =5.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468033111,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468034761,"data":"       | Then plug into AB^2: x_A^2 + y_A^2 =169 =\u003e 25 + y_A^2 =169 =\u003e y_A^2 =144 =\u003e y_A=12 (positive). So A=(5,12). Good.\n"}
