,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4372.468222484,"data":"       | Let Q = point along line AM: param t from A to M: Q = A + s*(M-A) where s ∈ [0,1] (since Q on segment). So coordinates: Q = (5 + s*(7-5), 12 + s*(0-12)) = (5 + 2s, 12 -12s) = (5+2s, 12(1 - s)).\n"}
