,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4400.316437333,"data":"       | k=1: pair (1,2). We must exclude k-1 =0 (not in set), k=1, k+1=2, k+2=3. So we remove {1,2,3}. Remaining numbers: 4..10 (length 7). Also we need to ensure no other consecutive pairs; we already removed 3, so 4 is not adjacent to pair. So we just need subsets of {4..10} with no consecutive numbers. That's interval length 7. So f(1) = a(7) = F_{9}.\n"}
