,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4400.316443809,"data":"       | Now for k=2: pair (2,3). Remove {1,2,3,4}. Remaining numbers: 5..10 (length 6). Also left side: numbers before 1? Actually after removal, we have left interval 0 length (since numbers 1..k-2 = 0). Wait for k=2: L = k-2 =0 (no numbers). Right interval length R = 10 - (k+2) = 10 -4 =6 (numbers 5..10). So f(2) = a(0) * a(6) = 1 * a(6) = a(6) = F_{8}.\n"}
