,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.667872184,"data":"       | Maybe we can set x = 1 - p, y = 1 - q, z = 1 - r. Then expression (1-x) = p etc. So product (1-x)(1-y)(1-z) = pqr. Square = (pqr)^2.\n"}
