,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.667889567,"data":"       | Similarly, 2y - xy = 2(1-q) - (1-p)(1-q) = 2 - 2q - (1 - p - q + pq) = 2 - 2q -1 + p + q - pq = 1 + p - q - pq.\n"}
