,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.667898624,"data":"       | Similarly for (2): 2y - yz = 2(1-q) - (1-q)(1-r) = 1 - q + r - q r? Let's compute: 2(1-q) = 2 - 2q. Subtract (1-q)(1-r) = 1 - q - r + qr. So 2 - 2q - (1 - q - r + qr) = 2 - 2q -1 + q + r - qr = 1 - q + r - q r. Good.\n"}
