,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.66790609,"data":"       | Similarly (3): 2z - zx = 2(1-r) - (1-r)(1-p) = 1 - r + p - r p? Let's compute: 2 - 2r - (1 - r - p + rp) = 2 - 2r -1 + r + p - rp = 1 - r + p - rp. Good.\n"}
