,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.668269296,"data":"       | But 1 - q^2 = cos^2 B, where q = sin B. Similarly 1 - r^2 = cos^2 C. Then sqrt{cos^2 B cos^2 C} = |cos B cos C| = q r = sin B sin C.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.668270631,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.668271734,"data":"       | Thus we have |cos B cos C| = sin B sin C.\n"}
