,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.668304364,"data":"       | Solve: subtract third from second: (A+B) - (A+C) = B - C = 2π/3 - π/3 = π/3 =\u003e B - C = π/3. Combined with B + C = π/2 =\u003e solving yields B = (π/2 + π/3)/2 = (3π/6 + 2π/6)/2 = (5π/6)/2 = 5π/12 = 75°. C = B - π/3 = 5π/12 - 4π/12 = π/12 = 15°. Then A = π/3 - C = π/3 - π/12 = 4π/12 - π/12 = 3π/12 = π/4 = 45°. So indeed.\n"}
