,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.670935501,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.670936674,"data":"       | y = 1 - cos (π/12) = 1 - cos 15° = 1 - (√6 + √2)/4 ≈ 1 - 0.9659 = 0.0341.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.670937938,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4452.670939073,"data":"       | z = 1 - cos (5π/12) = 1 - cos 75° = 1 - (√6 - √2)/4 ≈ 1 - 0.2588 = 0.7412.\n"}
