,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4482.93079541,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4482.930796506,"data":"       | Let’s denote t = a r^{m-1} is the smallest among selected terms (since r\u003e1). Then the largest term is t r^{k-1}. Condition:\n"}
