,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4511.417028596,"data":"       | We can compute using combinatorial enumeration:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4511.41703154,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4511.41703266,"data":"       | For each pair, we have categories:\n"}
