,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.656708399,"data":"       | (2) 4y ln x = 10 ln y\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.656709469,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.656710619,"data":"       | We can treat unknowns x\u003e1, y\u003e1.\n"}
