,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.656735063,"data":"       | Thus equation: 4 a * e^{b} = 100 a / e^a.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.656736149,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.656737178,"data":"       | Since a\u003e0, we can cancel a (assuming a ≠ 0, which is true as x\u003e1 =\u003e a\u003e0). So:\n"}
