,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.656926195,"data":"       | Compute derivative: g'(a) = (1 + 10/e^a) + a * (-10/e^a) * (-1)?? Wait derivative of 10/e^a = 10 * (-e^{-a})? Actually 10/e^a = 10 e^{-a}. Derivative: d/d a (10 e^{-a}) = -10 e^{-a}. So derivative of (1 + 10 e^{-a}) is -10 e^{-a}.\n"}
