,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.65736997,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.657371743,"data":"       | Now using \\(B/A=10/e^{A}\\) together with \\(A+B=2\\ln5\\) gives a unique\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.657375653,"data":"       | positive solution \\(A\\approx0.4282\\) (and \\(B\\approx2.791\\)), but the\n"}
