,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658967337,"data":"       | We also might need to show reasoning steps elegantly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658968557,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658969623,"data":"       | Let's craft final answer.assistantfinalLet  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658970769,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658971839,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658972961,"data":"       | \\log _x (y^{x}) =10 ,\\qquad \\log _y (x^{4y}) =10 ,\\qquad x\u003e1,\\;y\u003e1 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658974399,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658975505,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658976574,"data":"       | Using \\(\\log_a b=\\dfrac{\\ln b}{\\ln a}\\),\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658977951,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658980129,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658981278,"data":"       | \\frac{\\ln (y^{x})}{\\ln x}=10\\;\\Longrightarrow\\; \\frac{x\\ln y}{\\ln x}=10,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658982951,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658984069,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658986959,"data":"       | \\frac{\\ln (x^{4y})}{\\ln y}=10\\;\\Longrightarrow\\; \\frac{4y\\ln x}{\\ln y}=10 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658988415,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658989619,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658990679,"data":"       | Denote  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658991765,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658992849,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658994099,"data":"       | A=\\ln x\u003e0,\\qquad B=\\ln y\u003e0 .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658995401,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658996493,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658997619,"data":"       | Since \\(x=e^{A},\\;y=e^{B}\\), the two equations become  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.658999014,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659000135,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659001241,"data":"       | e^{A} B = 10A\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad 4e^{B}A = 10B .\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659002521,"data":"       | \\]\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659003624,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659004749,"data":"       | From the first, \\(B = 10A e^{-A}\\).  \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659005983,"data":"       | Insert this into the second:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659007142,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659008237,"data":"       | \\[\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659009357,"data":"       | 4e^{\\,10A e^{-A}}A = 10\\bigl(10A e^{-A}\\bigr)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4611.659010645,"data":"       | \\\n"}
