,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968802671,"data":"       | Let t minutes unknown. Let t_h = t/60 hours.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968803925,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968805035,"data":"       | Equation (1): 9/s = 4 - t_h\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968806225,"data":"       | Equation (2): 9/(s+2) = 2.4 - t_h\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968807548,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968808668,"data":"       | Subtract: 9/s - 9/(s+2) = (4 - t_h) - (2.4 - t_h) = 1.6\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.96880991,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968811035,"data":"       | Compute left side: 9 * [ (s+2) - s ] / [ s (s+2) ] = 9 * 2 / [ s (s+2) ] = 18 / [ s (s+2) ].\n"}
