,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968822121,"data":"       | Thus s^2 + 2s - 45/4 = 0.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.96882341,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4696.968824542,"data":"       | Multiply by 4: 4s^2 + 8s - 45 = 0.\n"}
