,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4713.311736238,"data":"       | Check: Standard cubic (k-1)(k-2)(k-3) = k^3 -6k^2 +11k -6. Yes.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4713.311739899,"data":"       | \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4713.311741018,"data":"       | Thus Q(k) = k + A (k^3 -6k^2 +11k -6) = A k^3 + (-6A) k^2 + (11A) k + (-6A) + k.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4713.31174232,"data":"       | \n"}
