,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":4713.311835331,"data":"       | Now compute Q(4) = 64 - 6*16 + 12*4 - 6 = 64 - 96 + 48 - 6 = (64 - 96) = -32, plus 48 = 16, minus 6 = 10.\n"}
